   2 |       3599.3    611.0 |     3464.6 |       3756.4    585.4 |  0.963  1.084  1.044 |      53.6 | ok (rel 0.0207)
   3 |       3541.4    621.0 |     3381.5 |       3699.8    594.4 |  0.955  1.094  1.045 |      54.4 | ok (rel 0.0233)

struct = ctrl/base: cost of the kernel restructuring alone (static
scheduler, swizzle, smem carveout; comm switched off).
comm = fused/ctrl: cost of the communication alone (flag publishes,
NVLink pulls, fp16 reduction, slowest-peer tail).
worst-rank: total 1.067, comm 1.095. flux pays this to keep the
epilogue local instead of remote-writing (v1 exp3 measures that option).
